 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "servers are [serverId, baseLoad]; requests are [timeSeconds (0..86399), serverId, rule] with rule LIGHT, STANDARD or HEAVY. Each request to a known server adds three independent components (all inferred): volume +1; intensity +0/+2/+5 for LIGHT/STANDARD/HEAVY; burst +3 when another request to the same server has a time in [t-60, t]. Requests for unknown servers are ignored. Return [serverId, score] in server input order.",
